{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45418","headline":"禁中法会应制 · 广宣","name":"禁中法会应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上万年枝，人间不可窥。\n道场三教会，心地百王期。\n侍读沾恩早，传香驻日迟。\n在筵还向道，通籍许言诗。\n空媿陪仙列，何阶答圣慈。\n从今精至理，长愿契无爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}